{"id":"wb-7-511","name":"柳中古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"柳中古城遗址","text":"柳中古城遗址（维吾尔老文字：لۈكچۈن قەدىمىي شەھەر خارابىسى，拉丁维吾尔文：Lükchün qedimiy sheher xarabisi）是位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区吐鲁番市鄯善县鲁克沁镇的古城遗址，现存遗址最早源自唐代，不过也存有吐鲁番回部札萨克多罗郡王额敏和卓的郡王府遗址和19世纪修建的城墙。柳中古城遗址面积达2平方千米，但保存不佳，现仅存西侧城墙数处。柳中古城遗址是第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93216963,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93216963","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4448ca021ff20f69bc884e0c.jpg","title":"柳中古城正面_Liuzhong_ruins.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2_Liuzhong_ruins.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2_Liuzhong_ruins.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​柳中古城正面","width":320,"height":240}}